# The director, second boot on the same world: the ledger and the stand-in came back from the save.
# The walker returns at once for its last victim, is banished, and every setting goes back.
/walkers director status
/walkers director standin list
/walkers director ledger
/walkers director return 1 now
/walkers director status 1
/walkers director end 1 banish
/walkers director ledger
/walkers director standin remove standin-1
/walkers config debug.standInVictims false
/walkers config director.minForestDensity 0.25
